title: $:/plugins/tiddlywiki/lucide-line/readme

This plugin contains all icons from https://lucide.dev/ and Lucide Lab as line icons. Size, stroke width and colour can be set with CSS or with the parameters `size` (default 24), `stroke` (default `currentColor`) and `stroke-width` (default 2), e.g. `{{$:/lucide/line/house|2em|red|1}}`.

Icons are tagged `$:/tags/Lucide/Line`. Lucide Lab icons are also tagged `$:/tags/LLab`.

Lucide Version: {{$:/plugins/tiddlywiki/lucide-line!!lucide-version}} -- License Info: see tab above.
